.TH SDL_TrayCallback 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_TrayCallback \- A callback that is invoked when a tray entry is selected.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_tray.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef void (SDLCALL *SDL_TrayCallback)(void *userdata, SDL_TrayEntry *entry);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I userdata
an optional pointer to pass extra data to the callback when it will be invoked\[char46]
.TP
.I entry
the tray entry that was selected\[char46]
.SH AVAILABILITY
This datatype is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_SetTrayEntryCallback (3)
